{"id":"a1ce5e591cd3d2b3","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-cm-curve.md","title":"CM Curve","display":"df-cm-curve — CM Curve","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cm-curve","aliases":["58-df-cm-curve","CM Curve"],"display":"df-cm-curve — CM Curve","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cm-curve"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cm-curve</span><span>CM Curve</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cm-curve — CM Curve"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"618616f65f4acd32\" href=\"?note=618616f65f4acd32\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md\">../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in V\">\\(E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CM}_S\\)</span> (complex-multiplication predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"618616f65f4acd32\" href=\"?note=618616f65f4acd32\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md\">../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CMCurve}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CMCurve}_S\\)</span> (metatheoretic CM-curve predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cm\\text{-}curve} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{CMCurve}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cm\\text{-}curve} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{CMCurve}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>CM: complex multiplication; endomorphism ring larger than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Z}\">\\(\\mathbb{Z}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>-invariant: CM <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>-invariants are algebraic integers (Heegner numbers)</li>\n<li>CM elliptic curves: explicit construction of abelian extensions of imaginary quadratic fields</li>\n<li>The alias remains at the metatheoretic level of its source predicate; it does not silently turn the externally specified regular-endomorphism ring into an object-language set term.</li>\n<li>Weber functions: define class invariants; modular functions on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0(N)\">\\(\\Gamma_0(N)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Silverman Advanced Topics in the Arithmetic of Elliptic Curves</li>\n<li>Cox, Primes of the Form <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^2 + ny^2\">\\(x^2 + ny^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md","status":"resolved","id":"618616f65f4acd32","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md","status":"resolved","id":"618616f65f4acd32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CM}_S$ (complex-multiplication predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CM}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CMCurve}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cm\\text{-}curve} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{CMCurve}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Z}","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0(N)","display":false},{"tex":"x^2 + ny^2","display":false}],"bytes":1234,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-350","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-cm-curve]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-297","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-cm-curve.md|58-df-cm-curve]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["618616f65f4acd32"]}